# 56x32 desk at 4x authoring density -- the SAME piece as desk.sprite, drawn on a
# grid big enough to hold what 14x8 could not: grain along the boards, a thin
# monitor bezel, readable screen content, individual keycaps, and the key
# light's top edge baked in.
#
# OPTIONAL. The cutaway prefers a `<name>_hi` frame ONLY when its size is
# exactly the render scale times the base frame's, and blits it 1:1 instead of
# block-scaling `desk`. A pack without this file renders exactly as before.
@frame 0
